# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Club documents — NEVER commit these
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Player agreements, legal notes and member records contain personal data
# (names, addresses, dates of birth, bank details). This repository is pushed
# to GitHub and deployed publicly. Keep these files locally or in the club's
# own document storage, not here.
